{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13525","headline":"代贺若令誉赠沈千运 · 王季友","name":"代贺若令誉赠沈千运","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢问姓名亦存，别时无子今有孙。\n山上双松长不改，百家唯有三家村。\n村南村西车马道，一宿通舟水浩浩。\n涧中磊磊十里石，河上淤泥种桑麦。\n平坡冢墓皆我亲，满田主人是旧客。\n举声酸鼻问同年，十人六七归下泉。\n分手如何更此地，回头不语泪潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}